# visual-feedback-pipeline transient artefacts.
# Spec: .kiro/specs/visual-feedback-pipeline/ (req 8.5).
#
# We commit: baselines/, config.json, report-template.html, this file.
# We ignore: any per-run timestamp directory under .kiro/screenshots/.
#
# Timestamp dirs are named YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS (snapshot-flutter, run-all).
# A wildcard like `[0-9]*` covers them without accidentally hiding
# `baselines/` (starts with `b`) or `config.json` (starts with `c`).

[0-9]*/

# Also ignore stray top-level PNGs (e.g. /tmp-copied artefacts left at root).
# Baselines and per-run images live in subdirs so the root should stay clean.
*.png
!baselines/*.png

# Smoke / scratch files used during pipeline development.
smoke-*
*.smoke.html
